{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-06_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-06","title":"Hold on Tight","storyCode":"2-6","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"4b49ea6ffee910fb1a8f51931680af3a949dcda175d2b5e493f9d31b390d1f3a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十八关（后）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Here we are."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"--? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to go up to the rooftop?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...This door is locked."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Stand back, I'll blast it open--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"There's no need for that."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Just kick it down."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Liskarm, you should learn from her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"I have my own way of doing things. Got a problem with that?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"There's another rooftop in front of us..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I think I'm beginning to understand..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"Amiya, over there! You'll be able to cross over from there!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Where is 'there'... Are you telling us to--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Jump from rooftop to rooftop?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Bingo~!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Who would ever expect this? See, this is foolproof!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"You know, Lungmen is a great place with many secrets--"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":true,"text":"You're not getting away!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"...Huh? What's going on? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Exusiai, the enemy showed up unexpectedly..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"I already sealed off the entrance, so how..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Could they have come from the nearby buildings..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"They seem to be wearing some rudimentary jetpack, but it's enough to get the job done."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We'd be at a disadvantage if they managed to sneak through places we aren't able to defend..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch... Hold on, I'll be there to help you shortly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't take too long, my little guardian angel."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Defenders, get into formation! Pronto!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"...I'm going in."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone, protect our vanguard!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]}]}
